## Project

SENTINEL-X is a research demonstrator: air-gapped heterogeneous Edge AI for
reconnaissance and human-in-the-loop situational awareness.

Target event: defence / security expo, 24 September 2026, Essen.
Position as a technology demonstrator, not a finished military product, and
not an autonomous weapon.

Intended stack (not built yet as a live system):
- Airborne: camera -> Jetson Orin NX (CV, RAG/VLM) + MCXN947 (independent verify)
- Ground: Raspberry Pi 5 (Whisper / local SLM / Piper) + operator

